      "text": "- Input/acquisition boundary — external data, device, request or user action enters the system.\n- Transformation/control boundary — project logic parses, schedules, routes, validates or transforms.\n- Persistence/output boundary — logs, reports, UI state, database records or generated artifacts leave the core logic.\n- External-platform boundary — libraries/cloud services/hardware remain dependencies rather than authored internals.\n- Trust boundary — credentials, identifiers or personal data require minimization and access control when present.\n---",
